    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a very... definitive way to put it. I suppose I've spent so much energy trying to rationalize the \"struggle\" as something meaningful, but listening to you, it sounds more like a futile resistance against an absolute certainity. Do you really think there's any inherent wisdom in simply accepting that silence?",
